{"product_id":"new-grade-9-1-edexcel-international-gcse-chemistry-exam-practice-workbook-includes-answers","title":"New Grade 9-1 Edexcel International GCSE Chemistry: Exam Practice Workbook (Includes Answers)","description":"\u003cp\u003eExam Board: Edexcel International GCSESubject: ChemistryFirst Teaching: September 2017   First Exams: June 2019This fantastic CGP Exam Practice Workbook is the perfect way to prepare for the Grade 9-1 Edexcel International GCSE Chemistry exams (and its great for the Chemistry parts of International GCSE Double Award Science too). Its packed with realistic exam-style questions for the entire course - with worked answers at the back. Every question is labelled with a grade range on the 9-1 scale, so its easy for students to focus practice on the difficulty level that suits them best. The book is rounded off with two mock exam papers to help make sure theyre 100% prepared for the real thing. Study notes for the whole course are available in our matching Revision Guide (9781782946762).\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 210 x 295\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Cgp Books\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781782946861\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages:\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45389444939929,"sku":"Edu-1-C9781782946861","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68230eb2d0811_New_Grade_9-1_Edexcel_International_GCSE_Chemistry.jpg?v=1747214698","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/new-grade-9-1-edexcel-international-gcse-chemistry-exam-practice-workbook-includes-answers","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}